- interceptor/proto/*.proto
  Vendored, unmodified, from OpenShell v0.1.2 (the tag and commit are in
  interceptor/proto/SOURCE). Each file keeps its upstream copyright and
  licence header.

- interceptor/_gen/*
  Generated by interceptor/regen.sh (grpcio-tools) from the protos above.
  Each file names the tag and the hash of each proto it was generated from.

- providers/amap-claude-code.json
  Adapted from OpenShell's providers/claude-code.yaml (v0.1.2). The changes
  are listed in providers/README.md.

