- router_sections.py
  Contains functions and classes copied from amap-deploy-sandy's
  router_health.py; the module docstring lists them and the commit.

- docs/index.html
  Its design, CSS, script and generic AMAP screens are adapted from
  amap-deploy-sandy's docs/index.html; a comment at its top says so.

- tests/test_no_hardcoded_expectations.py
  Ported from amap-deploy-sandy's test of the same name.

- payload/INBOX-POLICY.md
  amap-deploy-sandy's payload/INBOX-POLICY.md, with the named substitutions
  listed in tests/test_inbox_policy.py and nothing else.

- payload/mcp-servers.json
  amap-deploy-sandy's payload/mcp-servers.json, with the payload root
  replaced and the one named difference (decision D23) described in
  tests/test_mcp_servers.py.

These two payload files carry no header of their own, because tests compare
them with amap-deploy-sandy's text; this NOTICE is their attribution.
